    "execution": "Web3Auth imports makeADR36AminoSignDoc from the Cosmos barrel. The crypto key module immediately imports bitcoinjs-lib/ecpair and initializes ECC. Starknet has a statically bundled require inside a conditional address-calculation helper; bundled presence does not imply Starknet address calculation is used by Barney."
