  "directSubpathAssessment": {
    "suggestedEntry": "@keplr-wallet/cosmos/build/adr-36/amino",
    "removesCryptoBarrel": false,
    "reason": "The ADR-036 module itself unconditionally requires @keplr-wallet/crypto. Its CommonJS index unconditionally re-exports key.js, which contains the Bitcoin imports/ECC initialization and Starknet require. Selecting the ADR-036 subpath alone does not sever this dependency edge.",
    "baselineDifference": "The baseline Web3Auth consumer resolved Cosmos 0.12.28 and root crypto 0.12.28. The older crypto key module uses elliptic and crypto-js without the newer Bitcoin/Starknet paths. Remaining root crypto 0.12.28 in the current lock is not the Web3Auth Cosmos consumer copy.",
    "nextWork": "ENG-835: measure bundle budgets and wallet/provider lazy loading, or obtain an upstream modular ADR-036 entry. ENG-929: retain advisory review ownership. No dependency downgrade, alternate signer implementation or unmeasured byte-saving claim is proposed."
